====== NETGEAR GS108T v3======

The NETGEAR GS108T v3 (GS108T-300PES) is a Realtek based 8 port Gigabit L2 switch with 802.3af PoE <abbr title="Power Delivery">PD</abbr> (power input) on port 1 (yellow label underneath).

{{media:netgear:gs108t-v3:netgear-gs108t-v3.jpg?400||}}

